      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHIAN PEACHES (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (22.35) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Solid record here winning five races. Can atone. WHITE CAR (5) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 21.90 beating Slim Nikita. Form should stack up. ASSASSINO (2) is a well performed dog who recorded his 8th career win last time out at this track (21.96). Form here at the trip sound including four wins. The form out of his last race has been franked. Expected to measure up again. PACKHAM ROSE (8) won by a wide margin last start. Must be respected.",
